<style>
	.nav-transparent {
		transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
	}

	.nav-solid {
		transform: translateY(-100%);
		opacity: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), opacity 0.3s ease;
	}

	[data-header].scrolled .nav-transparent {
		opacity: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	[data-header].scrolled .nav-solid {
		transform: translateY(0);
		opacity: 1;
		pointer-events: auto;
	}

	[data-header].no-transition .nav-transparent,
	[data-header].no-transition .nav-solid {
		transition: none !important;
	}

	.nav-solid-bar {
		box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(10,26,52,0.25), 0 8px 16px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
	}

	/* Free shipping tab (phones; PDP clean brief, 22 Oct). Part of the navy
	   nav it hangs from, under the logo: it moves with the nav and has no
	   motion of its own (Tom, 22 Oct). Concave fillets join the nav to the
	   tab. Tab and fillets start 1px up inside the nav: where the nav's edge
	   falls between device pixels (125% display scaling) the nav and the
	   tab would each half-cover that row and leave a light seam. */
	.header-tab::before,
	.header-tab::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		width: 0.75rem;
		height: calc(0.75rem + 1px);
	}
	.header-tab::before {
		right: 100%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 0 100%, transparent 0.72rem, var(--color-main) 0.75rem);
	}
	.header-tab::after {
		left: 100%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, transparent 0.72rem, var(--color-main) 0.75rem);
	}
	/* One soft shadow under the navy nav and its tab together. */
	.header-shadow {
		filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 10px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-main) 16%, transparent));
	}
	@media (max-width: 767.98px) {
		/* Page load: the top nav, and the tab with it, slides down. */
		.nav-transparent {
			animation: header-drop 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) backwards;
		}
		.nav-solid {
			transition-duration: 0.5s, 0.3s;
		}
		.nav-solid-bar {
			box-shadow: none;
		}
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.header-shadow {
			filter: none;
		}
	}
	@keyframes header-drop {
		from { transform: translateY(-100%); }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.nav-transparent {
			animation: none;
			transition: none;
		}
	}

	/* Mobile menu animation */
	[data-mobile-menu] {
		transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
	}
	[data-mobile-menu].menu-closed {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(-8px);
		pointer-events: none;
	}
	[data-mobile-menu].menu-open {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(0);
		pointer-events: auto;
	}
</style>

{%- comment -%}
	Free shipping tab, phones only, hung under the logo of a navy nav row (the
	styles above): the floating nav on every page, and the top nav where that
	is navy (product pages). A see-through top nav has no edge to hang it from,
	so there it first shows when the floating nav slides in.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture shipping_tab -%}
	<div class="md:hidden absolute top-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2">
		<p class="header-tab relative -mt-px flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-b-xl bg-main px-3.5 pt-1 pb-1.75 font-body text-xs font-bold leading-4 text-white">
			{%- render 'icon-truck', classes: 'size-3.5 shrink-0' -%}
			{{- 'general.free_shipping_short' | t -}}
		</p>
	</div>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign navy_top = false -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'product' -%}{%- assign navy_top = true -%}{%- endif -%}

<header data-header class="fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50">

	{%- comment -%} ── Transparent nav — visible at page top ── {%- endcomment -%}
	<div class="nav-transparent {% if navy_top %}bg-main header-shadow{% else %}pt-2{% endif %}">
		<div class="container-contained relative flex items-center gap-4 md:gap-10 py-3" data-header-row="transparent">

			{%- comment -%} Mobile: hamburger at the start side {%- endcomment -%}
			<button
				class="md:hidden flex items-center text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-60"
				aria-label="{{ 'general.open_menu' | t }}"
				data-mobile-toggle
			>
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
					<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5"/>
				</svg>
			</button>

			{%- comment -%} Logo — centred on mobile, left on desktop {%- endcomment -%}
			<a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="flex items-center shrink-0 md:shrink md:grow-0 absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 md:static md:translate-x-0">
